@title Feature Flags: Build or Buy
@subtitle A quick decision page for the Growth team
@author Growth team, Pebble Bank

kpi Flags today | 140 | in a config file
kpi Time to flip one | 40 min | full deploy | bad

Today every flag change ships as a deploy. The options are LaunchDarkly, Unleash (self-hosted) and an in-house service.

# Comparison
table = Option,Annual cost,Setup time,Targeting rules,Audit log; LaunchDarkly,"$54,000",1 week,advanced,yes; Unleash,"$9,000 hosting",3 weeks,good,yes; In-house,no license cost,10 weeks,basic,would need building

# Recommendation
! Choose **LaunchDarkly**. It has the most advanced targeting rules, its audit log satisfies the compliance team, and it takes only 1 week to set up.

! Finance approved the $54,000 budget on 2026-10-14.

# Risks
- None of the options has an SDK for our COBOL batch jobs.
